00:43:48,054 --> 00:43:49,714
I used to blame my car.

1080
00:43:50,394 --> 00:43:52,094
I blamed the manufacturers.

1081
00:43:53,194 --> 00:43:54,914
I used to blame the company.

1082
00:43:55,894 --> 00:43:57,634
I blamed company policy.

1083
00:43:58,514 --> 00:44:00,934
I used to blame the training program.

1084
00:44:04,033 --> 00:44:05,894
I blame my negative relatives.

1085
00:44:05,894 --> 00:44:07,714
They were always putting me down.

1086
00:44:08,874 --> 00:44:10,454
I blame my cynical neighbors.

1087
00:44:10,554 --> 00:44:12,414
They're just selfish, looking out for themselves.

1088
00:44:12,694 --> 00:44:13,134
Won't loan you.

1089
00:44:13,234 --> 00:44:13,734
Won't loan you money.

1090
00:44:14,274 --> 00:44:15,154
They were on my list.

1091
00:44:20,194 --> 00:44:21,874
I used to blame the economy.

1092
00:44:23,154 --> 00:44:24,534
I blame the community.

1093
00:44:26,254 --> 00:44:27,184
That's a pretty good list

1094
00:44:27,184 --> 00:44:28,114
for not doing well, isn't it?

1095
00:44:28,674 --> 00:44:29,614
I thought it was good.

1096
00:44:31,014 --> 00:44:32,554
I'll never forget one day.

1097
00:44:33,294 --> 00:44:34,554
Mr. Shoff is very kind,

1098
00:44:34,554 --> 00:44:35,814
but he was also very blunt.

1099
00:44:37,054 --> 00:44:38,214
And this was no exception.

1100
00:44:38,854 --> 00:44:39,794
And I'm glad he was blunt.

1101
00:44:39,834 --> 00:44:40,864
There's a lot of things I'd

1102
00:44:40,864 --> 00:44:41,894
have missed if he hadn't been blunt.

1103
00:44:43,154 --> 00:44:44,274
One day, with sort of a

1104
00:44:44,274 --> 00:44:45,394
curious look on his face, he said,

1105
00:44:45,474 --> 00:44:47,274
Jim, just out of curiosity, tell me,

1106
00:44:47,574 --> 00:44:50,514
how come you haven't done well up until now?

1107
00:44:52,434 --> 00:44:53,774
Excellent question.

1108
00:44:56,854 --> 00:44:58,734
I thought, well, so I won't look too bad,

1109
00:44:58,834 --> 00:45:00,374
I'll go through my list.

1110
00:45:02,634 --> 00:45:03,944
And this list I just gave

1111
00:45:03,944 --> 00:45:05,254
you, I put that on him.

1112
00:45:06,274 --> 00:45:07,474
And he was very patient.

1113
00:45:07,714 --> 00:45:08,734
He let me go through the whole thing,

1114
00:45:08,814 --> 00:45:09,554
the government, the weather.

1115
00:45:09,654 --> 00:45:10,654
I went through this whole thing.

1116
00:45:11,554 --> 00:45:12,514
When I finished,

1117
00:45:12,514 --> 00:45:14,154
he looked my list over very carefully.

1118
00:45:14,614 --> 00:45:16,594
He said, Mr. Rohn, big problem with your list.

1119
00:45:16,894 --> 00:45:17,954
You ain't on it.

1120
00:45:21,293 --> 00:45:22,734
How brilliant.

1121
00:45:28,914 --> 00:45:30,073
When I went to work

1122
00:45:30,073 --> 00:45:31,233
for him a few months later,

1123
00:45:31,354 --> 00:45:33,474
I learned very quickly to tear up my list,

1124
00:45:33,574 --> 00:45:34,834
reasons for not doing well,

1125
00:45:34,934 --> 00:45:35,894
and I threw it away.

1126
00:45:36,214 --> 00:45:37,694
And I got me a fresh piece of paper.

1127
00:45:38,194 --> 00:45:39,714
And I put one word on it.

1128
00:45:40,754 --> 00:45:41,154
Me.

1129
00:45:43,334 --> 00:45:46,154
There's a black heritage spiritual that says

1130
00:45:46,254 --> 00:45:48,174
it's not my mother, nor my father,

1131
00:45:48,274 --> 00:45:49,274
nor my brother, nor my sister,

1132
00:45:49,374 --> 00:45:51,474
but it's me, oh Lord,

1133
00:45:51,474 --> 00:45:53,574
standing in the need of prayer.

1134
00:45:56,174 --> 00:45:57,794
See, I used to blame everything outside.

1135
00:45:58,794 --> 00:46:00,194
And then let me give you a little philosophy

1136
00:46:00,294 --> 00:46:01,374
that helped turn my life around.

1137
00:46:02,054 --> 00:46:04,094
For your notes, here it is.

1138
00:46:04,454 --> 00:46:10,234
It's not what happens.

1139
00:46:10,334 --> 00:46:10,894
If you ask,

1140
00:46:10,994 --> 00:46:11,554
The only faith you need is

1141
00:46:11,554 --> 00:46:12,114
a little bit more time and deeply,

1142
00:46:12,114 --> 00:46:15,854
that determines the quality or the quantity of your life.

1143
00:46:15,994 --> 00:46:17,454
It's not what happens.

1144
00:46:18,914 --> 00:46:20,524
And the reason is because

1145
00:46:20,524 --> 00:46:22,134
what happens happens to about everybody.

1146
00:46:22,634 --> 00:46:23,214
No different.

1147
00:46:24,634 --> 00:46:26,634
The sun went down on all of us last night.

1148
00:46:27,634 --> 00:46:29,814
A common event, a happening.

1149
00:46:30,694 --> 00:46:32,464
And I found out that the same

1150
00:46:32,464 --> 00:46:34,234
things can happen to two different people.

1151
00:46:34,234 --> 00:46:35,894
One gets rich and one stays poor.

1152
00:46:36,174 --> 00:46:37,334
Why is that?

1153
00:46:38,014 --> 00:46:41,114
It's because it's not what happens, but rather,

1154
00:46:41,114 --> 00:46:48,374
it's what you do that changes everything.

1155
00:46:50,714 --> 00:46:52,174
So that's a key phrase.

1156
00:46:52,294 --> 00:46:53,294
It's not what happens.

1157
00:46:53,334 --> 00:46:54,214
It's what you do.

1158
00:46:56,114 --> 00:46:58,034
What happens is about the same.

1159
00:46:58,154 --> 00:46:59,374
You might put that in parentheses here.

1160
00:46:59,754 --> 00:47:00,314
Same.

1161
00:47:00,534 --> 00:47:02,574
What people do, that's what's different.

1162
00:47:06,894 --> 00:47:08,014
Anything can happen, right?

1163
00:47:08,054 --> 00:47:08,854
Everything can happen.

1164
00:47:08,954 --> 00:47:09,854
I've heard all the stories.

1165
00:47:09,954 --> 00:47:11,094
I've been one of the stories.

1166
00:47:11,114 --> 00:47:14,814
Hey, we could all tell stories all night long, right?

1167
00:47:15,394 --> 00:47:15,794
Happenings.

1168
00:47:17,354 --> 00:47:18,314
Anything can happen.

1169
00:47:18,634 --> 00:47:20,054
Have you heard of Murphy's laws?

1170
00:47:20,354 --> 00:47:21,654
Anybody here heard of Murphy's laws?

1171
00:47:22,334 --> 00:47:23,294
Okay, most of you have.

1172
00:47:24,374 --> 00:47:25,554
Murph had these laws.

1173
00:47:26,434 --> 00:47:28,024
One of them was, if

1174
00:47:28,024 --> 00:47:29,614
anything can go wrong, it will.

1175
00:47:30,554 --> 00:47:31,854
That's one of Murphy's laws.

1176
00:47:32,974 --> 00:47:34,274
He was not one of the

1177
00:47:34,274 --> 00:47:35,574
great positive speakers of the day.

1178
00:47:35,714 --> 00:47:38,154
But anyway, it's still true though, right?

1179
00:47:38,174 --> 00:47:38,974
Anything can go wrong.

1180
00:47:39,034 --> 00:47:40,014
Everything can go wrong.

1181
00:47:40,014 --> 00:47:41,094
For sure.

1182
00:47:41,114 --> 00:47:46,554
I've fallen out of the sky so many times.

1183
