1204
00:48:25,914 --> 00:48:28,614
Heck, now you can whistle right on by zero, right?

1205
00:48:30,354 --> 00:48:31,394
They will bury you.

1206
00:48:31,434 --> 00:48:32,313
That's what they will do.

1207
00:48:37,714 --> 00:48:39,434
But see, those are the happenings, right?

1208
00:48:39,434 --> 00:48:40,253
Everything can happen.

1209
00:48:40,333 --> 00:48:41,094
Anything can happen.

1210
00:48:42,094 --> 00:48:43,774
But it's not the happenings.

1211
00:48:43,834 --> 00:48:45,034
It's what you do about it.

1212
00:48:45,893 --> 00:48:47,833
Somebody says, yeah, but you

1213
