1214
00:48:51,073 --> 00:48:52,274
Come on.

1215
00:48:53,474 --> 00:48:55,214
Everybody's had their share.

1216
00:48:56,674 --> 00:49:00,253
Disappointments are not special gifts reserved for the poor.

1217
00:49:01,373 --> 00:49:02,573
Everybody has them.

1218
00:49:02,794 --> 00:49:04,974
The difference is what you do about them.

1219
00:49:06,873 --> 00:49:08,154
It's not the weather.

1220
00:49:08,154 --> 00:49:09,873
I used to blame the weather.

1221
00:49:09,874 --> 00:49:12,354
And I discovered it rains on the rich.

1222
00:49:13,254 --> 00:49:14,774
So see, that won't help.

1223
00:49:16,334 --> 00:49:17,614
Two men wake up one morning.

1224
00:49:17,674 --> 00:49:18,514
There's a rainstorm on.

1225
00:49:18,774 --> 00:49:19,944
One of them looks out his

1226
