1230
00:49:26,034 --> 00:49:28,494
He stays home.

1231
00:49:30,234 --> 00:49:32,254
Same morning, the other guy looks out

1232
00:49:32,254 --> 00:49:34,274
his window, sees the same storm, says,

1233
00:49:34,374 --> 00:49:35,754
Wow, what a storm.

1234
00:49:36,394 --> 00:49:37,334
But he says, you know what?

1235
00:49:37,394 --> 00:49:38,584
With weather like this, what a great

1236
00:49:38,584 --> 00:49:39,774
day to go out and make sales.

1237
00:49:39,874 --> 00:49:42,124
Most everybody will probably

1238
00:49:42,124 --> 00:49:44,374
be home, especially the salesman.

1239
00:49:49,874 --> 00:49:51,654
See, that's the difference in how your life works out.

1240
00:49:51,654 --> 00:49:52,734
It's not what happens.

1241
00:49:52,734 --> 00:49:53,734
It's what you do.

1242
00:49:53,974 --> 00:49:55,994
So here's one of the key questions of the evening.

1243
00:49:56,034 --> 00:49:58,764
Starting tomorrow, what are you going to do

1244
00:49:58,764 --> 00:50:01,494
that will make a change in your life's direction?

1245
00:50:03,414 --> 00:50:04,154
Good question.

1246
00:50:04,334 --> 00:50:05,584
What are you going to do

1247
00:50:05,584 --> 00:50:06,834
starting tomorrow that will make a difference?

1248
00:50:09,334 --> 00:50:09,514
Now, see, if you don't know what

1249
00:50:09,514 --> 00:50:09,694
to do, you're going to do something.

1250
00:50:09,694 --> 00:50:09,764
If you don't know what to

1251
00:50:09,764 --> 00:50:09,834
do, you're going to do something.

1252
00:50:09,874 --> 00:50:11,374
If you don't do something starting tomorrow

1253
00:50:11,374 --> 00:50:12,874
that will make a difference, guess what?

1254
