It's going to be the same.

1255
00:50:20,014 --> 00:50:21,384
And see, that way you can guess what

1256
00:50:21,384 --> 00:50:22,754
the next five years are going to be like.

1257
00:50:22,854 --> 00:50:24,614
Look at the last five.

1258
00:50:26,474 --> 00:50:29,274
Because the next five are going to be like the

1259
00:50:29,274 --> 00:50:32,074
