1260
00:50:32,834 --> 00:50:33,694
Or change a little.

1261
00:50:33,974 --> 00:50:34,854
Or change something.

1262
00:50:35,374 --> 00:50:36,314
Or don't change.

1263
00:50:36,494 --> 00:50:37,334
It's choice time.

1264
00:50:37,394 --> 00:50:38,454
You can do whatever you want.

1265
00:50:38,454 --> 00:50:40,324
But it's nice to know any day

1266
00:50:40,324 --> 00:50:42,194
you wish, you can change your whole life.

1267
00:50:46,454 --> 00:50:48,914
What can you do starting

1268
