What can you do with a broken heart?

1272
00:51:02,134 --> 00:51:03,434
What can you do and it won't work?

1273
00:51:04,134 --> 00:51:04,814
Good question.

1274
00:51:08,454 --> 00:51:09,454
What?

1275
00:51:11,874 --> 00:51:12,174
Or what?

1276
00:51:12,354 --> 00:51:13,194
What?

1277
00:51:13,454 --> 00:51:13,574
What?

1278
00:51:14,034 --> 00:51:14,054
What?

1279
00:51:14,774 --> 00:51:15,214
Okay.

1280
00:51:16,274 --> 00:51:18,034
So what can you do?

1281
